{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日，英偉達創始人兼CEO黃仁勳因私人關係風波及相關國家安全爭議受到關注。11月8日，黃仁勳在一封致全體員工的內部信中承認自己對妻子不忠，並向家人、員工及公司股東致歉。同一天，英偉達董事會宣佈啓動獨立調查，調查緣由是近期有報道稱黃仁勳可能成為外國情報行動的目標。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585922.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.216569+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:48:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.419341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.419341+00:00","content_hash":"d7f48c9ef1aabb97a060e703b17650d3d03efb6921ff735375232bbfe6fa1bd6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}